{
  "The coming days as a list: each day with its appointments in time order, a day with none left out.": "",
  "`agenda` lists `agendaDuration` days from the date shown (7 by default). An appointment that lasts days is on each of them; one that takes the day says so. The list is a list box: the arrows move over its rows, and Space and Enter do what a click and a double click do.": "",
  "By resource": "",
  "With `groups`, each group's days stand under its name. A data source is asked for the days shown, as in the other views.": "",
  "`agendaRowTemplate` draws a row's content; `appointmentTooltipTemplate` the tooltip's, here and in every view.": "",
  "The row above or below (it is the selected one).": "",
  "The first and the last row; a screen of rows.": "",
  "Shows the tooltip, as a click does.": "",
  "Opens the form, as a double click does.": "",
  "Deletes the appointment (asking first).": "",
  "Today, the next and the previous days; `keys.agendaView` (A) shows the agenda.": "",
  "A list box; each day (in its group) is a group of options named by the day.": "",
  "An option per appointment: its text, its time, whether it goes on and how it repeats. The focused row is the selected one.": "",
  "With no appointments the list is left out and the text says so.": "",
  "Units: the list, a day (and the line over it), a group’s name.": "",
  "Units: a day’s head and its parts.": "",
  "Units: a row and its parts side by side.": "",
  "Units: the time column, the appointment’s colour (none unless a language draws it), the text, the empty text.": "",
  "Plain token: the time column’s width.": "",
  "The days the agenda shows, from the date shown; a view’s own wins. Previous and next move by them.": "",
  "With groups, each group’s days stand under its name (the group’s own appointments).": "",
  "A row’s content: `{ appointment, start, end, text, time, allDay, date, group }`; the row keeps its colour, keys and name.": "",
  "The tooltip’s content, in every view.": "",
  "\"No appointments\"": "",
  "What it says when its days have none (`uiLocale`).": ""
}
